@startuml creator-channel-ownership-state
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title Figure 4.3.3.3.1 Creator Channel Source State Diagram
hide empty description
state " " as Entry <<choice>>
[*] --> Entry : create channel
Entry --> PUBLIC : ingestCreatorData [new crawled identity] / save without master
Entry --> AUTHORIZED : confirm OAuth [verified new channel] / create and link owner
PUBLIC --> AUTHORIZED : link channel [verified OAuth or approved claim] / set master
AUTHORIZED --> PUBLIC : revoke claim [last ownership proof removed] / clear ownership
note bottom of AUTHORIZED
  Public ingestion preserves ownership. The chart models Creator.sourceType.
  Channel records can remain in either state indefinitely.
end note
@enduml
